        <p>The Impersonator.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-09-26_WidnesExaminer_art0003" n="art0003">
        <head>ICTUREDRO E</head>
        <p>ICTUREDRO E</p>
        <p>JOSEPH IVIOUNFIELD &amp; SONS, Proprietor: ARTHUR MOUNFIELD.</p>
        <p>THE VERY BEST AT THE LOWEST RATES.</p>
        <p>REFINEMENT. ECONOMY.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-09-26_WidnesExaminer_art0004" n="art0004">
        <head>FOR PLINERAL FURNISHING</head>
        <p>FOR PLINERAL FURNISHING</p>
        <p>PICIT ' OUSE</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-09-26_WidnesExaminer_art0005" n="art0005">
