      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-09-26_WidnesExaminer_art0029" n="art0029">
        <head>CLUB RUNS TO-DAY.</head>
        <p>CLUB RUNS TO-DAY.</p>
        <p>Warrington Wesleyan C.C.—Pickering Bridge. Sankey Bridges W.G.—Newton, via Burton- wood.</p>
        <p>St. George's.—Open run. LAMP TIME. To-day 7.5; next Saturday, 6.45. SILVER-STREET.</p>
