        <p>Hutting for Hsouinttein4g9of,oooroTniroeonpso.f the Army, in addition to many Territorial has been ordered, and it is anticipated tn; the huts will be ready by the end of NO% Quantities of the corrugated sheeting n are being supplied by Warrington &amp;Ills'</p>
