        <p>COUNTY BOROUGH OF WARRINGTON. Applications are invited for the position of FIREMEN in the Warrington Brigade, on the terms and conditions governing the services. Form of Application (which must be returned on or before the 10th October, 1914) may be obtained from the Superintendent at the Fire Station, Queen-street. Dated this 25th day of September, 1914. J. LYON WHITTLE, Town Clerk.</p>
        <p>COUNTY BOROUGH OF WARRINGTON. WAR OFFICE APPEAL FOR BLANKETS. I have to acknowledge the receipt of many bundles of Blankets for the use of Lord Kitchener's Army, which have been despatched as received. Blankets may be sent direct to the Army Ordnance Officer, Burscough; or to the Town Hall. PETER PEACOCK, Mayor.</p>
