        <p>RUNCORN UNION. TENDERS FOR PAINTING AND DECORATING. The Guardians of the above Union invite TENDERS for Outside PAINTING and Sunary Interior DECORATION at the Dutton Work- house, near Preston Brook, according to Specifi- cation prepared byl Messrs. Wright and Hamlvn, Sankey-street Chambers, Warrington, from whom copies of such Specification may be obtained. Tenders must reach my Office not later than 12 o'clock noon on Thursday, the let day of October, 1914. Persons desirous of tendering are hereby noti- fied that for the purposes of inspecting the premises the Master will be at liberty only on Tuesday, the 29th instant, between the hours of 10 a.m. and 4 p.m. The Guardians do not bind themselves to accept the lowest or any tender. GEO. F. ASHTON, Clerk to the Guardians. Union Offices, Runcorn, 24th September, 1914,</p>
